note Exercism-style exercise "isbn-verifier": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/isbn-verifier
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note isvalid is true when isbn, with its hyphens removed, is a valid ISBN-10: nine digits and a check
note digit or X (10), such that d1*10 + d2*9 + ... + d10*1 is divisible by 11.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/isbn-verifier
om2
fn isvalid isbn view uchar * to bool
k = ulong 0
t = ulong 0
for i ulong len isbn
c = get isbn i
if eq c 45
continue
end
d = ulong 0
if and ge c 48 le c 57
d = ulong sub c 48
else
if and eq c 88 eq k 9
d = ulong 10
else
ret false
end
end
if ge k 10
ret false
end
t = add t mul d sub 10 k
k = add k 1
end
ret and eq k 10 eq rem t 11 0
end
